- op: discuss  # 9ff4
  at: '2026-10-03T15:23:31Z'  # 9ff4
  by: agent  # 9ff4
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9ff4
  clock: 5  # 9ff4
  nonce: 9ff4  # 9ff4
  message: "Merged in PR #1415 (dev 1a7fcbff88). Integration: commits reordered pubin -> dahuh -> nakur so every commit is green; CI needed a schema-coverage baseline entry for the five values registered as pending (corpus has no LuaJIT FFI / N-API / Clojure multimethod code).\n\nFixed on jgstern-agent/fix/lijaz (7c7d53dac4, e2fdaaddc3).\n\n- **Before:** re-counting the item's 42 surveys against the registry gave 35 unregistered Edge.meta keys (the item's list), and no gate existed.\n- **Mechanism:** new `hypergumbo_core.meta_key_coherence` enumerates meta keys with `producer_coherence`'s site walk plus `value_flow`. `value_flow` no longer counts the read being answered as an escape, and gained opt-in `readers` / `known_empty`. A key at an `Edge` constructor must be on `edge_meta`; a post-hoc `.meta` key must be registered on some axis. This feeds the `Edge.meta key` axis of the shrink-only ratchet (`scripts/check-producer-axis-coherence`, `test_live_tree_producer_axis_ratchet`).\n- **Red:** with the registry unchanged, the ratchet listed 82 keys, including all 35.\n- **Green:** 73 edge_meta and 6 symbol_meta keys registered as emitted, and `symbol_roles` / `import_path` moved to `edge_meta`. `make_unresolved_edge`'s `enclosing_class` and `inherited_field_receiver` are registered, and `test_meta_key_coherence::test_it_reaches_the_items_named_instance` shows the scan sees them at `analyze/base.py`.\n- **Mutation:** unregistering `enclosing_class` turns the ratchet red, naming it.\n- **Baseline:** `route_path` (one axis per key; WI-kuhoh).\n- **NOT asserted:** Symbol construction keys (WI-rorap), keys read by consumers, the axis of post-hoc writes, or any fold audit of the registered keys."  # 9ff4
